{"articleNo":"991","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=991&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"교육역량) 공인어학시험 응시료 추가 지원 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.11.27","hit":"12055","attachments":[{"name":"어학시험 응시료 지원신청서 및 점수환산표1.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=991&attachNo=69278"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">&nbsp; 본 어학교육원에서는 <strong><u><font color=\"#013add\">2009년 교육역량강화사업 연계 공인어학시험 응시료 추가 지원사업</font></u></strong>을 아래와 같이 시행하오니 많은 학생들의 참여 바랍니다.&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\"><br>1. 추가지원 시험명 : <strong><u><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #acfafd\">특별TOEIC 및 정기,특별 TOEIC Speaking, OPIc, TEPS&nbsp;<br></font></u></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">2. 대&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; 상 : 본교 재학생(대학원생 및 휴학생 제외)&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">3. 응시료 지원기간 : <strong><u>2009년<font color=\"#f10b00\">12월</font>부터 시행되는 시험 응시자에 한하여 지급<br></u></strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;(지원횟수의 제한은 없음)&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">4. 금&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 액 : 응시료 전액<br><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font color=\"#0000ff\">&nbsp;(TOEIC Speaking 66,000원, OPIc 71,500원, TEPS 33,000원)</font></strong><font color=\"#0000ff\">&nbsp;<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">5. 시험일정</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">&nbsp; <strong><font color=\"#ff0000\">가. </font><font color=\"#ff0000\">특별 TOEIC시험</font> </strong>: <strong><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #befa5a\" color=\"#000000\">12월 27일(일)</font> / 접수기간 11월 30일(월) ~ 12월 17일(목)<br></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* 접수방법 : 어학교육원 행정실(이오스관 112호) <strong><font color=\"#013add\">방문접수</font></strong>(응시료 입금 필요없음),&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;정기토익시험과 동일하게 공인인정됨, 선착순접수</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><font color=\"#ff0000\">나. 정기 TOEIC Speaking</font> </strong>: <strong><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #a8f32a\">12월 6일(일)</font> / 접수기간&nbsp;~ 12월 2일(수)<br></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #befa5a\">12월 13일(일)</font> / 접수기간&nbsp;~ 12월 9일(수)</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">&nbsp; <strong><font color=\"#ff0000\">다. 특별 TOEIC Speaking</font> </strong>: <strong><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #befa5a\">12월 18일(금),19일(토)</font> /&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 접수기간 11월 30일(월) ~ 12월 10일(금)<br></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;*접수방법 : 어학교육원 행정실(이오스관 112호) <strong><font color=\"#013add\">방문접수</font></strong>(응시료 입금 필요없음), 선착순접수</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><font color=\"#ff0000\">라. </font><font color=\"#ff0000\">OPIc 정기시험</font> </strong>: <strong><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #fbbcff\">12월 9일(수)</font> / 접수기간&nbsp;~ 12월 6일(일)<br></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\"><strong><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #fbbcff\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; </font>12월 16일(수)</font> / 접수기간 ~ 12월 13일(일)<br></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\"><strong><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #fbbcff\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </font>12월 23일(수)</font> / 접수기간 ~ 12월 20일(일)<br></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\"><strong><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #fbbcff\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </font>12월 30일(수)</font> / 접수기간 ~ 12월 27일(일)</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <font color=\"#013add\">* 특별토익 및 특별스피킹시험은 방문접수이며, 그 외의 시험은 인터넷 개별접수이고&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 성적표 발급 받은 후 응시료지원 신청하시면 됩니다.</font></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">6. 지원조건 :&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 최초 응시료 지원을 받는 자는 이전 성적과 상관없이 학년별 성적기준만 만족하면&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 응시료 지원을&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">받을 수 있다. (금회 성적표 사본만 제출)&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 나. 최초 응시료 지원을 받은 이후로는 이전 지원시보다 점수가 향상되어야 하며, 학년별&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 최소점수 이상을 획득하여야 한다. TOEIC점수를 기준으로 <strong><font color=\"#ff0000\">1,2학년은 300점, 3학년은&nbsp;400점, 4-5학년은 500점</font></strong>을 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">원칙으로 한다.(시험간 점수환산표 참조)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">7. 접 수 처 : 해당 종합학사행정실(디지털관,글로벌관,테크노관) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">8. 응시료 지원 신청기간 :&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 가. <strong><u><font color=\"#0162f4\">12월 : 12월 14일(월) ~ 18일(금)</font>&nbsp;<br></u></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 나. <font color=\"#013add\"><strong><u>1월 : 1월 11일(월) ~ 15일(금)</u></strong> </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">9. 제출서류 : <strong>응시료 지원신청서 1부.<br></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;(단,12월 특별토익 및 스피킹시험은 무료응시이므로 응시료 지원신청 필요 없음)&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 응시료 지원기간 내 전회 및 금회 성적표 사본 각 1부.</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (토플 시험의 경우 환율에 따라 응시료 금액이 달라지므로 응시료 입금영수증 제출바람)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">10. 기타문의 : 어학교육원 행정실(478-7221)&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
